<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sinnoh, at last! You came over on the\nCherrygrove ferry too, didn’t you?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Strange days. Trainers from Johto and\nKanto just walking around Sinnoh…\fI don’t mind it one bit, honestly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This city’s barely changed since I was\nlittle. The rest of the world sure has.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokémon Center will patch up your\nteam. The clerk at the mart still\fstocks the good stuff, too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sailors say you can walk the coast for\ndays and never leave Sinnoh.\fI say let them try HOENN’s beaches.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Watch the tall grass around here.\nThe wild Pokémon aren’t shy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve been walking this route for years.\nStill find new Pokémon every season.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A storm’s always brewing off Mt. Coronet.\nDress warm, trainer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My team’s in top shape--but league rules\nsay exhibition matches only this month.\fCome find me when the season opens!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I used to battle every trainer who made\neye contact. I’m retired now.\fMostly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A lady told me the ferry goes all the\nway to JOHTO! That’s across the SEA!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m gonna catch a STARLY and name it\nMister Feathers!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In my day, crossing regions took weeks\nby boat. Now look at you youngsters.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The old legends of Sinnoh live in these\nmountains. Tread kindly, child.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The current’s gentle today. A strong\nswimmer could cross to the far shore.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Me? I just like watching the water.\nThe Pokémon under there like it too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ahoy! You look like an explorer.\nTake these--the full set of\fHIDDEN MACHINES!\rUse them from the bag: the field\nmoves work as long as you carry them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got your HMs already!\nGo see the world, trainer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0830_APOCSIN_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Acuity Lakefront</language>
	</row>
